# Route: guide 37 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to
# 57, 35 quests, 3.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Eastern Plaguelands, Teldrassil, Azshara, Felwood): Light's Hope
# Chapel -> The Infectis Scar -> Light's Hope Chapel -> Darrowshire -> The
# Undercroft -> Terrordale -> Light's Hope Chapel -> Quel'Lithien Lodge ->
# Light's Hope Chapel -> The Fungal Vale -> The Undercroft -> Thondroril River
# -> Terrordale -> ….
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Dawn's Gambit (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The
# Active Agent (5213), The Great Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243),
# The Archivist (5251), Above and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls (5282),
# Menethil's Gift (5463), Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Dead Man's Plea (8945),
# Anthion's Old Friend (8948), In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls
# (1199).

